---
title: Spanish Beef Stew With Pimenton and Piquillo Peppers
description: This Spanish beef stew combines tender braised beef with smoky paprika, roasted peppers, and red wine for a hearty, deeply flavored dish.
image: https://www.seriouseats.com/thmb/I1chslZy73gdvX54pdiX7dyM_ro=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20250922-SEA-20250922-SEA-SpanishBeefStew-AnhNguyen-33-0e6cde78796c47fab77b1d5e62a85126.jpg
servings: 6
